config CORNE_STATUS_SERVICE
    bool "Expose keyboard status (profiles, bonds, layer) over a custom GATT service"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_BLE && (!ZMK_SPLIT || ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL)
    help
      Adds a read-only, encryption-protected GATT characteristic with the
      active BLE profile, each profile's bond and connection state, and the
      highest active layer. Read by the vhr.corne Omarchy bar widget.
      Only the central half talks to the host, so it defaults to on there.
